# Infra rules

## Overview
- UI: S3 + Cloudflare (`infra/terraform/envs/web`)
- API: **AWS API Gateway HTTP API** (`infra/terraform/modules/api_gateway`) + Auth0 JWT
- API domain: `api.get1agent.com` → Cloudflare CNAME → API Gateway
- Data: RDS PostgreSQL + on-demand **jumpbox EC2** (`infra/terraform/modules/vpc_rds`); public IPv4 only while `db-access.sh` runs
- Tool Lambdas: `infra/terraform/modules/lambda_tool` (Go tools in `tools/`)
- Backend Lambdas: `infra/terraform/modules/lambda_rds` (TypeScript in `backend/`, registry in `backend/registry.json`)
- API routes: `infra/terraform/envs/prod/api_gateway.tf`

## GitHub Actions
- **Infra** — bootstrap / web / frontend / prod (checkboxes)
- **Backend** — one checkbox per Lambda = deploy
- **Tools** — one checkbox per tool = deploy

## Deploy scripts
- `infra/aws/deploy-all.sh` — full infra apply
- `infra/aws/deploy-infra.sh` — Terraform only
- `infra/aws/db-access.sh` — start jumpbox, SSM tunnel to RDS, stop on exit (minimal IPv4 cost)
- `infra/aws/cleanup-legacy-aws.sh` — remove Kong-era EIPs, SGs, Secrets Manager secrets
- `infra/aws/deploy-backend.sh` — package/deploy backend/* Lambdas

Full guide: **`infra/DEPLOY.md`**

## GitHub secrets
- `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID`, `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`
